  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    This Lens allows you to create music using the AI Lyria API by Google. 
     1. Look down and click on the button to spawn the music menu
    2. Once the menu is visible start to pick your favorite styles to mix together on the carousel
    3. Press on Generate and wait for your creation to finsh
    4. Click on Play to hear to your new creation  Requirements: Set up Snap Cloud storage bucket to stored generated audio and Edge Function to transcode to the right format - see README.md 
